This Court has considered the following facts while exercising discretion in favour of the applicant :-
(i) the applicant is in jail since 19.04.2023;
(ii) the investigation is over and the charge-sheet is filed;
(iii) applicant is alleged to be a proposed receiver of the illegal liquor;
(iv) present applicant is not named in the FIR;
(v) illegal liquor has not been recovered from the possession of the present applicant;
(vi) trial will take its own time;
6.

